# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Collaborator source material -- deliberately not redistributed here.
#
# Slide decks, raw full-wave exports and annotated review copies belong to
# their authors and are unpublished. Only the parameters extracted from
# them (data/*_parameters.md, data/*_spectrum.csv) and figures prepared
# for our own documents are tracked.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
*.pptx
*_AA.pdf

# Reference material: an unpublished collaborator draft and a publisher PDF.
references/
data/**/*.mat
data/**/*.m

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local working notes, not part of the public record
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
CLAUDE.md

# Quarto rendered HTML (regenerable from the .qmd source)
*.html
*_files/
